        "created_at": "2014-10-15T05:13:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p><p>I was playing the first scenario for Uprising this weekend and the hero players pointed out that the Thug doesn't specify enemies only for its hazard spaces. So when I spawned Thugs next to my underbosses or The Operative, they attacked that character if they didn't move away. Is this intended?&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:42.640Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
