        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi,</p><p>I was playing the first scenario for Uprising this weekend and the hero players pointed out that the Thug doesn&#39;t specify enemies only for its hazard spaces. So when I spawned Thugs next to my underbosses or The Operative, they attacked that character if they didn&#39;t move away. Is this intended?&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
